  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> be the solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to :"
  },
